# Valor's Flagship (7/7 Vehicle, Flying, first strike, lifelink, Crew 3): a Pilot token made by cycling the first Flagship (X = 1) is
# a 1/1 that crews Vehicles as though its power were 2 greater, so it alone makes the crew 3 (CR 702.122a). Bot1 casts the second
# Flagship on turn 3 ({4}{W}{W}{W} from seven Moxes, three of them Pearls) and crews it with the Pilot (summoning-sick Vehicles
# can't attack, so it only becomes a 7/7 artifact creature). On turn 5 it is crewed again and attacks: lifelink gains Bot1 7 life
# as the 7 damage goes to Bot2 (CR 702.15b).

